{"id":"aile","lemma":"aile","pos":"noun","rank":2094,"glosses":["wing (of a bird or other flying animal; of poultry; of an aircraft; of a building; of an army; in football and rugby; in politics)","fender, wing (of an automobile)","side, wing, ala"],"ipa":"/ɛl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/32/Fr-aile.ogg/Fr-aile.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ailes"},"formAudio":{"ailes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-ailes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"L'hôpital a trois ailes.","en":"The hospital has three wings.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"hospital"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Un oiseau a des ailes.","en":"A bird has wings.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"bird"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Cet oiseau a une aile cassée.","en":"This bird has a broken wing.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"bird"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"broken","l":"cassé"}]},{"text":"Les oiseaux ont des ailes.","en":"Birds have wings.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"bird","l":"oiseau"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"L'aile était très cabossée.","en":"The fender was badly dented.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"dented","l":"cabossé"}]}]}